==Trivia==

* The Giant is 1 of 19 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Minions]], [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Balloon]], [[Golem]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Phoenix]], [[Lava Hound]], and the [[Archer Queen]].
** The Heroic Giant mostly resembles the Level 13 Giant from Clash of Clans. His [[Star Points|Star Level 2 skin]] resembles the Level 5 Giant from Clash of Clans.
* The Giant is 1 of 7 [[cards]] that are already unlocked for the player when they start playing the game, the others being the Minions, Archers, [[Knight]], [[Arrows]], [[Tower Princess]], and [[Fireball]]. Despite this, the game recognizes that those cards are unlocked in the [[Training Camp]].
* The Giant is one of the first troops to be featured in Clash-A-Rama, alongside the Minions, Goblins, and Barbarians.
* The Giant is one of the first troop cards to be featured in a [[Training Camp|Trainer]]'s [[Battle Decks|deck]], alongside the Minions, Archers, Knight, [[Spear Goblins]], Goblins, [[Bomber]], Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Minion Horde]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Musketeer]], Valkyrie, Wizard, Hog Rider, [[Baby Dragon]], [[Skeleton Army]], Witch, P.E.K.K.A., [[Prince]], and Balloon.
* The Giant is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the Archers, Knight, Goblins, Bomber, Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Bats]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Rascals]], Musketeer, Valkyrie, Wizard, [[Flying Machine]], Hog Rider, [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], Baby Dragon, Skeleton Army, Witch, P.E.K.K.A., Prince, Balloon, [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], Wall Breakers, Bowler, Cannon Cart, [[Mega Knight]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], Lava Hound, [[Night Witch]], and [[Fisherman]].
* The Giant is 1 of 14 troops that has been featured with a [[Buff#Rage|Rage]] [[buff]], the others being [[Electro Spirit]], Zappies, [[Guards]], Giant Skeleton, Goblin Giant, Electro Dragon, Wall Breakers, [[Electro Giant]], Mega Knight, Ram Rider, [[Electro Wizard]], [[Sparky]], and Royal Ghost.
** He is the first troop to be featured with a buff.
* The Giant is 1 of 3 troops that has had its Melee range classification changed, the others being Mini P.E.K.K.A. and P.E.K.K.A..
* According to The Art of Supercell, the Giant was originally supposed to be blue.
* The Giant shares the first part of his description with the Golem.
* The Giant is 1 of 15 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] which bring an excited reaction from the audience upon spawning and brings a collective groan from the audience when defeated, as well as a concerning gasp when the opponent plays him and applause when he's destroyed, the others include [[Royal Giant]], P.E.K.K.A., Giant Skeleton, [[Rune Giant]], Goblin Giant, Golem, Bowler, Electro Wizard, [[Inferno Dragon]], Sparky, Lava Hound, Night Witch, [[Super Lava Hound]], and the [[Monk]].
* The Giant, along with the Goblins, Barbarians, Valkyrie, Wizard, Hog Rider, Witch, P.E.K.K.A., and the Archer Queen, was featured as a non-playable opponent in [https://www.chess.com/ Chess].
* The Giant, along with the Archers, Goblins, Barbarians, [[Ice Spirit]], Mini P.E.K.K.A., Musketeer, Wizard, Hog Rider, Witch, Prince, and Night Witch, is featured as a sticker in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IMessage iMessage], in a sticker pack called [https://apps.apple.com/us/app/clash-theater-stickers/id1353823484 Clash Theater].
* In [[Pass Royale|Fisherman's Float]], Giants can be seen sitting in the audience.
* The Giant is the subject of a few [[Emotes]].
* The Giant was featured in the winning decks of multiple Clash Royale Tournaments. More specifically:
** The Giant was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxEzjdKQ4HA Clash Royale Helsinki Tournament], by a player called Jason.
** The Giant was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kIGdeKaT_is The Crown Duel Tournament], by a player called Backstabx.

* The Heroic Giant is no longer 1 of 6 troops that cannot deal damage to other troops whatsoever, the others being the Royal Giant, Hog Rider, Royal Hogs, Elixir Golem, and Rune Giant.

* Before the Giant's card release, the Giant's Hitpoints were increased by 11%, and his Damage was increased by 4%.

* The Heroic Knight was one of the first [[Heroes]] to be added in the game, alongside the [[Knight/Hero|Knight]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A./Hero|Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], and [[Musketeer/Hero|Musketeer]].

